0.071 0.125 0.188 rg
52. 765.8899999999999864 Td
(Has GARIL AI undergone a security audit?) Tj
ET
BT
/F1 9.8 Tf
11.2699999999999996 TL
0.137 0.157 0.188 rg
52. 751.8899999999999864 Td
(Yes. A defensive security audit was completed \(September 2026\) with remediation verified in October 2026.) Tj
ET
BT
/F1 9.8 Tf
11.2699999999999996 TL
0.137 0.157 0.188 rg
52. 739.3899999999999864 Td
(Critical findings were closed. See the Institutional Security Assurance Summary.) Tj
ET
BT
/F2 11 Tf
12.6499999999999986 TL
0.071 0.125 0.188 rg
52. 719.8899999999999864 Td
(Are you SOC 2 certified?) Tj
ET
BT
/F1 9.8 Tf
11.2699999999999996 TL
0.137 0.157 0.188 rg
52. 705.8899999999999864 Td
(Not yet. We provide a SOC 2 readiness and control mapping. A formal SOC 2 Type II attestation requires an) Tj
ET
BT
/F1 9.8 Tf
11.2699999999999996 TL
0.137 0.157 0.188 rg
52. 693.3899999999999864 Td
(independent CPA engagement, which can be commissioned when a partner requires it.) Tj
ET
BT
/F2 11 Tf
12.6499999999999986 TL
0.071 0.125 0.188 rg
52. 673.8899999999999864 Td
(Is data isolated per university?) Tj
ET
BT
/F1 9.8 Tf
11.2699999999999996 TL
0.137 0.157 0.188 rg
52. 659.8899999999999864 Td
(Yes for administrative scope: university admins are constrained to their institution. Research and portal assets are) Tj
ET
BT
/F1 9.8 Tf
11.2699999999999996 TL
0.137 0.157 0.188 rg
52. 647.3899999999999864 Td
(ownership/tenant filtered. Platform-wide backups are super-admin only.) Tj
ET
BT
/F2 11 Tf
12.6499999999999986 TL
0.071 0.125 0.188 rg
52. 627.8899999999999864 Td
(How is authentication handled?) Tj
ET
BT
/F1 9.8 Tf
11.2699999999999996 TL
0.137 0.157 0.188 rg
52. 613.8899999999999864 Td
(Email/password with scrypt hashing, JWT access tokens \(24h\), hashed password-reset tokens, active-status) Tj
ET
BT
/F1 9.8 Tf
11.2699999999999996 TL
0.137 0.157 0.188 rg
52. 601.3899999999999864 Td
(enforcement, rate-limited auth endpoints, and default-deny API access.) Tj
ET
BT
/F2 11 Tf
12.6499999999999986 TL
0.071 0.125 0.188 rg
52. 581.8899999999999864 Td
(Is encryption used?) Tj
ET
BT
/F1 9.8 Tf
11.2699999999999996 TL
0.137 0.157 0.188 rg
52. 567.8899999999999864 Td
(TLS is required at the reverse proxy for production. Security headers including HSTS are enabled in production.) Tj
ET
BT
/F1 9.8 Tf
11.2699999999999996 TL
0.137 0.157 0.188 rg
52. 555.3899999999999864 Td
(Database/object-storage encryption at rest should be enabled on the hosting infrastructure per institutional) Tj
ET
BT
/F1 9.8 Tf
11.2699999999999996 TL
0.137 0.157 0.188 rg
52. 542.8899999999999864 Td
(standards.) Tj
ET
BT
/F2 11 Tf
12.6499999999999986 TL
0.071 0.125 0.188 rg
52. 523.3899999999999864 Td
(Where is data stored?) Tj
ET
BT
/F1 9.8 Tf
11.2699999999999996 TL
0.137 0.157 0.188 rg
52. 509.3899999999999864 Td
(On the deployment’s MongoDB and optional S3-compatible storage \(often a university or partner VPS\). AI) Tj
ET
BT
/F1 9.8 Tf
11.2699999999999996 TL
0.137 0.157 0.188 rg
52. 496.8899999999999864 Td
(prompts are processed by the configured model provider — see Subprocessors PDF.) Tj
ET
BT
/F2 11 Tf
12.6499999999999986 TL
0.071 0.125 0.188 rg
52. 477.3899999999999864 Td
(Can we complete a DPIA?) Tj
ET
BT
/F1 9.8 Tf
11.2699999999999996 TL
0.137 0.157 0.188 rg
52. 463.3899999999999864 Td
(Yes. Use the Data Protection Overview, Subprocessors, Incident Response, and AI Governance documents as) Tj
ET
BT
/F1 9.8 Tf
11.2699999999999996 TL
0.137 0.157 0.188 rg
52. 450.8899999999999864 Td
