ET
BT
/F2 11 Tf
12.6499999999999986 TL
0.071 0.125 0.188 rg
52. 431.3899999999999864 Td
(What happens in a breach?) Tj
ET
BT
/F1 9.8 Tf
11.2699999999999996 TL
0.137 0.157 0.188 rg
52. 417.3899999999999864 Td
(Follow the Incident Response Overview: contain, investigate, notify institutional security/DPO contacts under the) Tj
ET
BT
/F1 9.8 Tf
11.2699999999999996 TL
0.137 0.157 0.188 rg
52. 404.8899999999999864 Td
